{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 45, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "John bolted upright in bed, the fluorescent glow of a digital sun assaulting his eyes. The room—if it could be called that—was a bizarre fusion of his bedroom and a pixelated landscape, the walls shifting between smooth textures and jagged, low-resolution edges. His hands, which should have been flesh and blood, flickered like a glitching avatar, their edges occasionally dissolving into static. Panic surged through him as he stumbled to the window, only to find the outside world replaced by a grid of floating numbers and a distant, blocky mountain range. The air hummed with an otherworldly energy, and the sound of his own heartbeat was drowned out by a synthwave melody that seemed to pulse from the very walls.\n\n***\n\nDesperate to understand what was happening, John stumbled through the surreal landscape of his new reality, his movements stiff and unnatural like a character controlled by an unseen hand. He encountered other figures—humans, or at least they looked human—who moved in jerky, predetermined patterns, their conversations filled with repetitive phrases and exaggerated gestures. A child-like NPC approached him, offering a quest to \"defeat the final boss\" in exchange for \"experience points,\" but John ignored it, his mind racing. He soon discovered a hidden corner of the game world where the code was visible, a tangled mess of text and symbols that made his stomach churn. As he reached out to touch it, a message flashed on the screen: *\"Player error. Respawn in 5... 4... 3...\"* Before he could react, the world dissolved into darkness.", "logprobs": [{"token": "John", "logprob": -1.1913195848464966}, {"token": " bolt", "logprob": -3.394822835922241}, {"token": "ed", "logprob": -3.3378546504536644e-06}, {"token": " upright", "logprob": -9.42901024245657e-05}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.056759607046842575}, {"token": " bed", "